@startuml
' Authored fixture (svg-sprite-nanoparser, 2026-07-30).
' Sprite declarations are copied VERBATIM from assets/stdlib -- a stdlib
' bundle is itself just a .puml of `sprite <name> <svg ...>` lines, so an
' inline declaration is the identical parse path. Inlined rather than
' !include'd because the golden harness (renderFixture) runs the
' preprocessor with no include resolver; no other golden uses !include.
' Two sprites with an IDENTICAL declared 16x16 box but different drawn ink:
' bi-globe's outer circle is an ARC and UPath.addInternal records only an
' arc's endpoint, so it inks 16x13.846; bi-bootstrap-fill inks the full box.
' Pins declared-vs-ink channel independence at the golden level.
